<view class="page">
  <view class="card empty" wx:if="{{!hasMenu}}">
    <view class="empty-icon">🍳</view>
    <view>还没有今日菜单</view>
    <button class="btn-primary empty-btn" bindtap="onGoIndex">去生成今日菜单</button>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{hasMenu}}">
    <view class="card head">
      <view class="card-title">{{dateLabel}} 购物清单</view>
      <view class="muted head-note">
        按 {{memberCount}} 口人份量换算 · 还需购买 {{buyableCount}} 样 · 点击条目可标记"家里已有"
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card" wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="category" wx:for-item="g" wx:for-index="gi">
      <view class="card-title">{{g.icon}} {{g.category}}</view>
      <view class="divider"></view>
      <view
        class="item {{it.checked ? 'checked' : ''}} {{it.pantry ? 'pantry' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{g.items}}"
        wx:key="name"
        wx:for-item="it"
        wx:for-index="ii"
        data-gi="{{gi}}"
        data-ii="{{ii}}"
        bindtap="onToggleItem"
      >
        <view class="checkbox">{{it.checked ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
        <view class="item-name">{{it.name}}</view>
        <view class="item-amount">{{it.amountText}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card muted how">
      💡 一键购买说明：点击下方按钮后清单会自动复制，在奥乐齐小程序 / 盒马 App 的搜索框粘贴食材名称即可快速加购。生鲜按最接近的规格购买即可，略有富余不影响营养搭配。
    </view>

    <view class="bottom-space"></view>
    <view class="bottom-bar">
      <button class="btn-ghost bar-btn" bindtap="onCopyList">📋 复制清单</button>
      <button class="btn-primary bar-btn" bindtap="onBuyAldi">奥乐齐下单</button>
      <button class="btn-primary bar-btn hema" bindtap="onBuyHema">盒马下单</button>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
